OL,3,CPolice officer injured as football
OL,4,Cfans pull down fencing
OL,6,FAn investigation is underway after a
OL,7,Fpolice officer suffered a minor injury
OL,8,Ffollowing the weekend's south coast
OL,9,Fderby between Southampton and
OL,10,FPortsmouth.
OL,12,FSupporters from both sides pulled down
OL,13,Ffencing in Melbourne Street and Marine
OL,14,FParade at the end of the EFL
OL,15,FChampionship clash, which finished 1-0
OL,16,Fto Saints, Hampshire Police said.
OL,18,FHowever, "decisive action" from
OL,19,Fofficers and stewards prevented either
OL,20,Fside from breaching the fence and
OL,21,Fcoming face-to-face.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
