PN,38102
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F381A1793370480
OL,3,CPolice officer injured as football
OL,4,Cfans pull down fencing
OL,6,FThe disruption delayed coaches, which
OL,7,Fwere transporting Portsmouth
OL,8,Fsupporters, from leaving St Mary's.
OL,10,FAssistant Chief Constable Simon Dodds
OL,11,Fsaid the force prevented any "serious
OL,12,Fdisorder", describing its policing
OL,13,Foperation as "really successful".
OL,15,F"I would like to thank the
OL,16,Fprofessionalism of our officers and
OL,17,Fstaff who worked alongside both clubs
OL,18,Fto make sure this was another safe
OL,19,Fgame for all," he said.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'R(,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng SportCWeatherFRewind
FL,382,410,120,120,000,100
PN,38103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F381A1793370480
OL,3,CPolice officer injured as football
OL,4,Cfans pull down fencing
OL,6,FFour people were arrested as part of
OL,7,Fthe force's policing operation,
OL,8,Fincluding a 38-year-old man, who was
OL,9,Fapprehended on suspicion of
OL,10,Fobstructing the highway as Portsmouth
OL,11,Fsupporter coaches left the city.
OL,13,FTwo men - who were aged 20 and 18
OL,14,Frespectively - were arrested on
OL,15,Fsuspicion of possessing a flare, while
OL,16,Fa 50-year-old man, who was not
OL,17,Fattending the game, was arrested on
OL,18,Fsuspicion of shoplifting and
OL,19,Fpossessing an offensive weapon in
OL,20,Fpublic.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/4
