OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F381A1793370480
OL,3,CPolice officer injured as football
OL,4,Cfans pull down fencing
OL,6,FSouthampton, who were reduced to 10-
OL,7,Fmen, won the match courtesy of a first-
OL,8,Fhalf strike from defender James Bree.
OL,10,FThe win capped off a dramatic week for
OL,11,Fthe club, with manager Tonda Eckert
OL,12,Fescaping any serious punishment from
OL,13,Flast season's Spygate scandal with a
OL,14,Fsuspended six-week ban.
OL,16,FReporting History sees journalists
OL,17,Fjoin News At Ten anchor Tom Bradby to
OL,18,Frevisit their remarkable on-the-day
OL,19,Freports of the defining events of the
OL,20,Fmodern age. Listen to the episodes
OL,21,Fbelow...
